      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Forest Hills Tennis Club was featured in the 2001 film The Royal Tenenbaums, where Luke Wilson’s character plays a match.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
