      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "From 1915 to 1978, the Forest Hills arena hosted Open Tennis Championships and legendary acts like the Beatles, Simon & Garfunkel, and Bob Dylan.",
